  },
  {
    "INDEX": 12.0,
    "TIME": {
      "SHOW": 35.4,
      "HIDE": 37.6
    },
    "SCRIPT": {
      "KOREAN": "내 눈에는 귀엽기만 하는데 왜!",
      "ENGLISH": "But to me, it just looks cute! Why?!",
